REST API. Can an agent change my monitors safely? + It can change them directly, within the token you give it: the MCP server acts on your workspace through the API, and changes apply at once. If you want a review step, keep monitors in devhelm.yml and have the agent open a pull request instead. Book a demo Ship the monitor in the same PR as the feature  Start free, commit one file with your monitors and an alert channel, get your first alert. No credit card. Terminal npm install -g devhelm Start free — no credit card Book a demo Product Synthetics Webhook Testing Email Testing Build with DevHelm Developers Design partners Contact Company Security Privacy Terms DevHelm .io All systems operational © 2026 DevHelm.io Monitors are files. Review them like code. — DevHelm

